# BP Dumper — no Microsoft Store in member UI

**Hard rule:** Do **not** add a Microsoft Store download, Store setup path, or Store "Recommended" badge to the member-facing Dumper Apps modal / Downloads.

Member Windows install is **GitHub Releases `DumperApps.exe` only** (plus Python scripts zip for non-Windows / advanced).

## Do not

- Re-add `windows-store` / `BP_DUMPER_STORE_*` links to `BP_DUMPER_DOWNLOADS`
- Tell members to install from Partner Center / apps.microsoft.com
- Commit Store / MSIX packaging, Partner Center identity, or Store upload scripts to this public repo
- Attach a Store package to GitHub Releases
- "Fix" Partner Center submissions unless the maintainer explicitly asks

Store packaging stays **local only** (outside this repo). Do not rebuild or promote a Store client from GitHub.

## Portable exe note (allowed)

The unsigned `DumperApps.exe` description may warn that Windows Defender / SmartScreen often block it (false positive). That is fine — do not respond by bringing Store back.
